{"name":"Americano","hex":"#463732","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Americano","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative letter-case form of americano.","An American."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Americano"}],"entries":[{"title":"Caffè americano","blocks":[{"text":"Caffè americano, also known as americano or American, is an espresso shot with hot water at a 1:3 to 1:4 ratio, resulting in a drink that retains the complex flavors of espresso, but in a lighter way. Its strength varies with the number of shots of espresso and the amount of water added. The name of the drink may also be written with Italian spelling and diacritics as \"caffè americano\", or Portuguese and Spanish spelling and diacritics as \"café americano\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Espresso_Americano.jpeg/330px-Espresso_Americano.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caff%C3%A8_americano","wikidata":"Q1152551"},{"title":"Americano (cocktail)","blocks":[{"text":"The Americano is an IBA official cocktail composed of Campari, sweet vermouth, and for the sparkling version, club soda and garnished with a slice of lemon or an orange twist."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Americano_cocktail_at_Nightwood_Restaurant.jpg/330px-Americano_cocktail_at_Nightwood_Restaurant.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Americano_(cocktail)","wikidata":"Q467441"},{"title":"Americano (song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Americano\" is a song recorded by American singer Lady Gaga, taken from her second studio album, Born This Way (2011). The song was written and produced by Gaga with DJ White Shadow, Fernando Garibay, and Brian Lee. \"Americano\" was influenced by the events surrounding the repeal of the controversial California Proposition 8—a ballot proposition that defined marriage as a union between opposite-sex couples, thereby prohibiting and invalidating same-sex marriage throughout the state—as well as the growing struggles of Mexican immigrants. It combines mariachi, house, and techno genres with elements from Latin music. Lyrically, the song talks about Lady Gaga's infatuation with a woman."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/86/Lady_Gaga_-_Americano_%28vinyl%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Americano_(song)","wikidata":"Q2342866"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Espresso_Americano.jpeg/500px-Espresso_Americano.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Espresso_Americano.jpeg/1280px-Espresso_Americano.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/41/Espresso_Americano.jpeg/500px-Espresso_Americano.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEspresso_Americano.jpeg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Caff%C3%A8_americano_in_the_Philippines.jpg/500px-Caff%C3%A8_americano_in_the_Philippines.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Caff%C3%A8_americano_in_the_Philippines.jpg/1280px-Caff%C3%A8_americano_in_the_Philippines.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Caff%C3%A8_americano_in_the_Philippines.jpg/500px-Caff%C3%A8_americano_in_the_Philippines.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Americano as served in the Phili